Output workspace.gif

Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1600
Set Height 900
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 60ms
Set PlaybackSpeed 1.0
Set Shell zsh

Hide
Type "source ~/.zshrc 2>/dev/null; clear"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Show

Type "cd ~/code/anansi"
Enter
Sleep 500ms

Type "zellij --layout hono"
Enter
Sleep 5s

Ctrl+t
Sleep 400ms
Right
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 3s

Type "explique-moi en 2 phrases ce que fait ce projet anansi"
Sleep 800ms
Enter
Sleep 8s
